  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      414.07,
      286.43,
      489.68
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following Land/Servitude which is required for a Public purpose mentioned below.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      57.84,
      494.47,
      223.8,
      504.55
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      505.06,
      288.84,
      577.04
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of land bearing Lot 01 (Extent : 2.8578 Hec.) depicted in the preliminary Survey Plan No. MR/2728, situated in the Village of Naotunna, Grama Niladhari Division of Talalla North in Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Devinuwara, Matara District, Southern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.119687795639038,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      582.36,
      286.45,
      646.88
    ],
    "text": "1. Lot No. 01 Name of the land: Godaudahena, Galkattawehena alias Galkattawa; Description: 7 Jak trees aged about 20-25 years, Teak trees aged 15-20 years, Mixed cultivation with cinnamon trees; Extent 2.8578 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.9198079109191895,
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      646.4,
      286.53,
      748.4
    ],
    "text": "All Persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a Servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Devinuwara on the 25th day of April, 2018 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 09th day of April, 2018 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      360.32,
      539.41,
      381.92
    ],
    "text": "the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
